/P 1095 0 R
/E (Everything around us is part of our environment. Our environment includes all the things we see around our homes, schools, communities and other places where we live. When we look carefully, we can find many different things such as plants, animals, water, soil, stones, houses, tables, books and vehicles.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
